1. Hyder Asws. Ke Matamdaro'n Mein Hyder Asws. Ka Janaza Uth-ta Hai. <br>
<br>
pehlu Ko Sambhale Roti Hui Purse Ko Aayi Zehra S.a. Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
2. Sajde Mein Ibne Muljim L.a. Ne Talwaar Chalayi Dhoke Se. <br>
<br>
do Neem Hua Sar Hyder Asws. Ka, Fawwara Qoon Ka Behta Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Meesam As., Salma'n A.s., Meqdaad A.s., Kumail A.s, Malik A.s., Ammar A.s., Abuzar A.s. Bhi. <br>
daale Hue Sar Par Qaake Aza, Har Ek Sahabi Rota Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
4. Tha Waqte Naz'aa Moula Ka Mere, Saasa R.a., Ne Kiye Us Waqt Sawaal.<br>
<br>
is Karb Ke Aalam Mein Bhi Ali Asws., Paigham E Quda Jjh. Pohonchata Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
5. Shabbar Asws. Ke Hawale Sabko Kiya, Rote Hai Tadapkar Shahe Wafa Asws. <br>
<br>
abbas Asws. Se Bole Shere Quda Asws., Shabbir Asws. Tumhara Aaqa Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
6. Jaate Hue Hyder Asws. Kufe Ke Logo Se Wasiyat Karte Hai. <br>
<br>
zainab Asws. Ko Meri Tum Yaad Rakho Phir Lout Ke Isko Aana Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Qatil L.a. Ko Sheer Diya Tumne, Aur Bande Rasan Bhi Khulwaye. <br>
<br>
zainab S.a. Ke Bazu Sheh Ka Gala, Kya Yaad Ali Asws. Ko Aaya Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
8. Do Baar Janaza Ut-ttha Hai, Hyder Asws. Ka Shehr E Koofa Mein. <br>
<br>
hai Karbobala Mein Lashe Pidar, Zanjeer Mein Jakda Beta Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
9. Koozo'n Mein Doodh Liye Bache, Moula Ki Ayaadat Ko Aaye. <br>
<br>
par Dashte Bala Mein Sheer Kaha'n Pani Bhi Waha'n Par Mehenga Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
10. Beto'n Se Kehte Hai Moula, Aawaz Na Ghairo'n Tak Pohonche. <br>
<br>
kulsoom S.a. Aur Zainab S.a. Ka Rona, Hyder Asws. Ko Bohot Tadpata Hai. <br>
<br>
<br>
11. Shahzade Ki Yeh Anjuman Moula Ke Matam Ko Aayi. <br>
<br>
meyaar Hamara Kya Ho Bayaa'n Zehra S.a. Ne Dua Mein Maanga Hai.